%% ============================================================
%% 2. LOGIN & SESSION MANAGEMENT  
%% ============================================================
graph TD
    Start2([User Login]) --> InputLogin2[Input Email/Phone & Password]
    InputLogin2 --> FindUser2[Cari User by Email/Phone]
    
    FindUser2 --> UserExists2{User<br/>Ditemukan?}
    UserExists2 -->|No| ErrorLogin2[Error: User tidak ditemukan]
    ErrorLogin2 --> End2Fail([Login Gagal])
    
    UserExists2 -->|Yes| CheckPassword2{Password<br/>Match?}
    CheckPassword2 -->|No| ErrorPassword2[Error: Password salah]
    ErrorPassword2 --> End2Fail
    
    CheckPassword2 -->|Yes| CheckStatus2{User Status<br/>= ACTIVE?}
    CheckStatus2 -->|No| ErrorStatus2[Error: User PENDING/SUSPENDED/DISABLED]
    ErrorStatus2 --> End2Fail
    
    CheckStatus2 -->|Yes| GenSession2[Generate Random Session Token<br/>Store Hash in user_sessions]
    GenSession2 --> SetCookie2[Set HttpOnly Secure Cookie<br/>Expires: 8 hours]
    SetCookie2 --> UpdateLastLogin2[Update last_login_at]
    UpdateLastLogin2 --> LoadRoles2[Load User Roles & Permissions]
    LoadRoles2 --> End2Success([Login Success<br/>Session Created])
